{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/89c04639e14165b29e8f31c52c3e6530.avif?t=1763359293\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to experience a thrilling top-down arcade racing game that's inspired by the classic 90s racing games you know and love.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Power Racing League is the prestigious racing competition where ruthless competitors from around the world come together to tear up the track and power their way to victory</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.poster.avif?t=1763359293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.webm?t=1763359293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.mp4?t=1763359293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race through checkpoints before you explode in &quot;Timebomb&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/1bae9f9cdb8436f4dd020855597a258d.poster.avif?t=1763359293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/1bae9f9cdb8436f4dd020855597a258d.webm?t=1763359293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.